          "phrases": [
            {"target": "안녕하세요. 반갑습니다.", "en": "Hello. Nice to meet you."},
            {"target": "감사합니다. — 네, 괜찮아요.", "en": "Thank you. — Yes, no problem."},
            {"target": "죄송합니다. — 괜찮아요.", "en": "I'm sorry. — It's okay."},
            {"target": "안녕히 가세요. — 안녕히 계세요.", "en": "Goodbye. (to leaver) — Goodbye. (to stayer)"}
          ],
          "grammar_note": "안녕하세요 covers hello at any time of day. 'Bye' splits in two: 안녕히 가세요 to someone leaving the place, 안녕히 계세요 if YOU are leaving. Politeness is encoded in the verb ending, not the word for hello.",
